# Custom Domain Support Template for GitHub Pages
# =================================================================
# INSTRUCTIONS FOR ADDING A CUSTOM DOMAIN IN THE FUTURE:
# 
# 1. When you purchase your custom domain (e.g. www.mtlcityrp.com), 
#    rename this file from 'CNAME.template' to simply 'CNAME' (with no extension).
# 2. Open the file and replace the commented lines below with ONLY your domain name on line 1:
# 
# mtlcityrp.com
# 
# 3. In your DNS provider (GoDaddy, Namecheap, Cloudflare, etc.), configure:
#    - A Records pointing to GitHub Pages IP addresses:
#      185.199.108.153
#      185.199.109.153
#      185.199.110.153
#      185.199.111.153
#    - CNAME Record for 'www' pointing to yourusername.github.io.
# 4. In your GitHub Repository, go to Settings -> Pages, confirm your custom domain, and check "Enforce HTTPS".
# =================================================================
